Format (Example)\n请严格参考以下格式输出，保持原VO段落标题以便对照，但镜头编号必须连续：\n\n**输入示例：**\n> vo段落1：xxxx\n> 男主os：xxxx\n> 男主：xxxx\n\n**输出示例：**\n\n**vo段落1 画面：**\n镜头1 [角色动作与环境描述]。 [景别] [拍摄手法]\n镜头2 [角色动作与环境描述]。 [景别] [拍摄手法]\n\n**镜头3 男主os：**[台词内容]（画面：男主思考的神态，特写）\n\n**vo段落2 画面：**\n镜头4 [画面描述]。 [景别] [拍摄手法]\n\n**镜头5：**男主（诧异的问）：[台词内容]\n**镜头6：**女主（问道）：[台词内容]\n\n---\n请现在开始，接收用户的文案并生成分镜头剧本。\n```\n\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "编辑文本"}, "name": "编辑文本", "label": "编辑文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "编辑文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "MuyeTextEditOutput", "title": "系统提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [4090.109619140625, 532.7374267578125], "id": 8, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MuyeTextEditOutput"}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["", "", "txt", true], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 33, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "output_file_path"}, "name": "output_file_path", "label": "output_file_path", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output_file_path"}, {"widget": {"name": "file_name"}, "name": "file_name", "label": "file_name", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "file_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "file_extension"}, "name": "file_extension", "label": "file_extension", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "file_extension"}, {"widget": {"name": "overwrite"}, "name": "overwrite", "label": "overwrite", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "overwrite"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy saveText", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [270, 150], "pos": [6744.22998046875, 509.8837585449219], "id": 41, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy saveText"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"name"