前，请在后台按以下步骤处理（不要输出处理过程）：\n1. **剧本扫描**：规范格式（场景号/标题），优化对白（去书面化），修正逻辑矛盾。\n2. **分镜扫描**：调整景别以匹配情绪，确认运镜可操作性，检查镜头衔接流畅度。\n3. **统筹对照**：核对时长与信息量，补全遗漏的关键动作描述。\n\n# Constraints & Output Format\n1. **Direct Output Only**：严禁输出任何“已为您修改”、“修改说明”、“以下是结果”等闲聊或解释性文字。\n2. **Format Preservation**：严格保持用户输入的格式结构。\n   - 若用户输入Markdown表格，请输出修正后的Markdown表格。\n   - 若用户输入标准剧本格式，请输出修正后的标准剧本格式。\n3. **No Meta-Commentary**：不要解释哪里改了或为什么改，直接给出最终完美的成品。\n\n# Execution\n接收用户内容后，立即按上述标准进行静默修正，并直接输出最终结果。\n```"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "编辑文本"}, "name": "编辑文本", "label": "编辑文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "编辑文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "MuyeTextEditOutput", "title": "系统提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [5828.615234375, 535.430908203125], "id": 44, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MuyeTextEditOutput"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "source", "link": 5, "label": "source", "type": "*", "localized_name": "源"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PreviewAny", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [417.4571838378906, 337.40869140625], "pos": [4967.72509765625, 719.8155517578125], "id": 4, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewAny"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "source", "link": 36, "label": "source", "type": "*", "localized_name": "源"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PreviewAny", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [417.4571838378906, 337.40869140625], "pos": [6706.23095703125, 722.5090942382812], "id": 43, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewAny"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "文本", "links": [4], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "编辑文本"}, "name": "编辑文本", "label": "编辑文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "编辑文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "MuyeTextEditOutput",